  dialogNodes:
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Now, you''ve bought your first items. Congrats!


      We wouldn''t
      want you to damage them and blame me for selling faulty merchandise. So here
      is how to properly use them.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Do you see those buttons above your XP bar?


      Click the inventory
      button and you''ll see everything you''ve bought.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: YOU CAN SEE MY XP BAR TOO?
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Yes. Anyway.


      Right click items to equip them.

      You
      can also click the character button, and drag your items there.

      That
      will also show you your stats.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'That''s about it.


      Return soon for more good deals!'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
